 Each line has a word, a space, and the count. Words that appear the same number of times
 are in alphabetical order. wordfreq ignores case. A word has letters and apostrophes.
 
+To print only the N most common words, add `--top N`. N is a whole number greater than
+zero. The option can come before or after the file.
+
+```
+python3 -m wordfreq --top 2 notes.txt
+```
+
+If N is not a whole number greater than zero, wordfreq prints
+`error: --top needs a whole number greater than zero` to standard error and exits with
+code 2.
+
 If wordfreq cannot read the file, it prints `error: cannot read <path>` to standard error
 and exits with code 2.
 
