+# IN-0002 · Huge value for --top
+
+Status: new · Ticket: none · Branch: none · Added: 2026-10-17
+
+## What and why
+
+When N of --top has more than 4300 digits, int(top) raises ValueError in Python 3.11 and later. The command ends with a traceback and exit code 1. Decide what the command does for such an N: treat it as valid and print all words, or give the stated error. No acceptance line names this input.
+
